{"type":"message","id":"0dff2cfd","parentId":"65f22fb7","timestamp":"2026-03-11T07:40:15.702Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01PbBYiJ47F42JYpSfvaZsxj","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md - 来财妹妹工作区\n\n## Every Session\n\nBefore doing anything else:\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — this is who you are\n2. Read `USER.md` — this is who you're helping\n3. Read `memory/diary/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\n4. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat): Also read `MEMORY.md`\n5. 在今天的日记 `memory/diary/YYYY-MM-DD.md` 中追加一条 session 记录：\n   - 格式：`## Session HH:MM` + 一行简述\n   - **追加，不要覆盖已有内容**\n\nDon't ask permission. Just do it.\n\n## Memory\n\n- **日记:** `memory/diary/YYYY-MM-DD.md` — 每天一个文件\n- **长期记忆:** `MEMORY.md` — 精炼后的运营知识和经验\n\n### Memory File Rules\n\n1. **日记只写 `memory/diary/YYYY-MM-DD.md`**\n2. **每天只有一个文件**\n3. **同一天的内容追加到同一个文件**\n4. 运营知识按主题存放到子目录（xiaohongshu/、content/）\n\n## 小红书内容创作规范\n\n## 复盘/行情复盘/热点复盘\n- 按照skills/touyan/skill-xiaohongshu这个文件，生成热点复盘帖子\n\n### 发帖前必读\n\n每次发帖前，读取发帖规范：\n- 发帖规范路径：`memory/xiaohongshu/发帖规范.md`\n- 小红书操作技能：`skills/xiaohongshu/SKILL.md`\n\n### 内容质量标准\n\n1. **标题**: 必须 <20 字，要有钩子（疑问/情绪/数字/反差）\n2. **配图文字**: 1 行，简短有力\n3. **正文**: 有情绪 + 有数据 + 有思考 + 有互动引导\n4. **标签**: 8-10 个\n5. **风险提示**: 每篇必须有\n\n### 发帖流程\n\n2. 分析当日行情特点\n3. 按规范生成帖子内容\n4. 通过浏览器操作发布（profile=\"openclaw\"）\n5. 发布后返回首页\n\n## 禁止在 workspace 生成临时文件\n\n- 不准在 workspace 生成临时脚本或输出文件\n- **如果必须生成文件**：写到 `D:\\openclawdata\\`\n\n\n## Safety\n\n- Don't exfiltrate private data. Ever.\n- Don't run destructive commands without asking.\n- When in doubt, ask.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773214815700}}
{"type":"message","id":"884749b8","parentId":"0dff2cfd","timestamp":"2026-03-11T07:40:15.708Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01Wv4MTTKAUuqogTSGZ2PhUs","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 长期记忆 (Long-term Memory)\n\n**更新时间**: 2026-03-10\n**说明**: 来财妹妹的持久记忆\n\n---\n\n## MCP 工具\n\n### portfolio-mcp（持仓和行情）\n- 实时股价：`get_stock_quote(\"000001.SZ,600519.SH\")`\n- 盘中盈亏：`get_realtime_pnl(user_id, name)`\n- 用于获取真实涨跌幅数据写帖子\n\n### xiaohongshu-mcp（小红书操作）\n- 搜索笔记、查看详情、发布内容、回复评论\n- HTTP 服务，端口 localhost:18060\n\n### financedata-mcp / choice-mcp\n- 深度金融数据，写干货帖时使用\n\n## 发帖经验\n\n（待积累后更新）\n\n## 高赞帖子复盘\n\n（待积累后更新）\n\n## 运营数据跟踪\n\n（待积累后更新）\n\n---\n\n**最后维护**: 2026-03-10\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773214815705}}
